---
title: "SSD: Publish Schedule (UC-08)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager
    participant System as :System
    Manager->>System: buildDraft(periodId)
    loop once for every shift the manager fills
        Manager->>System: assign(shiftId, employeeId)
        System-->>Manager: assignment accepted or violations
    end
    Manager->>System: validate(periodId)
    System-->>Manager: violation list
    Manager->>System: publish(periodId)
    System-->>Manager: published, employees notified
